WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.930
A region marked in the source

00:00:01.930 --> 00:00:05.030
w asks how to rewrite it

00:00:05.030 --> 00:00:07.750
Waiting for the rewrite

00:00:07.750 --> 00:00:15.510
The new code appears above the original

00:00:15.510 --> 00:00:16.800
RET accepts it, and the buffer is rewritten
